%% Draft diagram. Application verification: NOT_RUN.
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Player
    participant E as Native events
    participant P as Clip planner
    participant O as External OBS
    participant I as Local clip index
    U->>P: Explicitly start media session
    P->>O: Authenticate loopback WebSocket v5
    Note over U,O: No implicit microphone or remote upload
    alt Authentication or startup fails
        O-->>P: Recording unavailable
        P-->>U: Reason-coded recording status
    else Recorder ready
        O-->>P: Replay buffer ready
        E-)P: Admitted session event before audio filtering
        E->>E: Continue native alert and audio policy
        Note over E,P: Event delivery and clip work cannot block critical audio
        P->>P: Target event minus 30s to event plus 15s
        P->>P: Schedule save after required post-roll
        P->>O: Request bounded replay save
        alt Save fails, times out or session becomes stale
            P-->>U: Failure, no saved clip claim
            Note over E,O: Recorder failure leaves valid local alerts active
        else Actual save receipt arrives
            O-->>P: Saved path and actual buffer times
            P->>P: Trim and verify actual covered interval
            P->>I: Record verified output, coverage and gaps
            I-->>U: Clip with actual interval, partial when needed
        end
    end
